; The compiled call runs on the host, on test devices, and on the Metal, CUDA,
; NV and AMD devices the machine has, its programs from the compile cache.
; reports.t pins the lines RUNE_JIT_DEBUG prints, which the call reads once.
; The suite runs as eight shards: its memory tests collect the whole heap, and
; a process that ran the suite's other tests holds every program it compiled.

